# {{appNameBase}} SDK - AI Agent Reference

## Installation

Add to your `pubspec.yaml`:

```yaml
dependencies:
  {{packageName}}: ^{{packageVersion}}
```

Then run:

```bash
dart pub get
```

## Quick Start

```dart
import 'package:{{packageName}}/{{packageName}}.dart';

final client = {{clientClassName}}.withToken(
  host: 'https://api.example.com',
  accessToken: 'your-token',
);
```

## Authentication

All authentication is handled via `Authenticator` implementations passed to the client constructor.

### Bearer Token

```dart
final authenticator = BearerAuthenticator(host: 'https://api.example.com', token: 'your-token');
final client = {{clientClassName}}(authenticator: authenticator);
```

{{#hasBasicAuth}}
### Basic Auth

```dart
final authenticator = BasicAuthenticator(
  host: 'https://api.example.com',
  username: 'username',
  password: 'password',
);
final client = {{clientClassName}}(authenticator: authenticator);
```

{{/hasBasicAuth}}
{{#hasApiKeyAuth}}
### API Key

```dart
final authenticator = ApiKeyAuthenticator(
  host: 'https://api.example.com',
